    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "category": "benji",
      "title": "周本紀第四",
      "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-004-zhou:p007",
      "count": 4,
      "quote": "以待士，士以此多歸之。伯夷、叔齊在孤竹，聞西伯善養老，盍往歸之。太顛、閎夭、散宜生、鬻子、辛甲大夫之徒皆往歸之。",
      "work_id": "w-shiji",
      "book_id": "b-shiji-004",
      "chapter_id": "c-shiji-004-zhou",
      "source_id": "s-shiji-004-zhou",
